            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequence of Hydrogenibacillus schlegelii MA48, a Deep-Branching Member of the Bacilli Class of Firmicutes.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e00380-16</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.00380-16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report here the draft genome sequence of Hydrogenibacillus schlegelii MA48, a thermophilic facultative anaerobe that can oxidize hydrogen aerobically. H. schlegelii MA48 belongs to a deep-branching clade of the Bacilli class and provides important insight into the acquisition of aerobic respiration within the Firmicutes phylum.</AbstractText>
